2 CONT '''Probate record (04-05-1740; Osmund was dead at the time, and his heirs were listed as his widow Berte Salvesdatter, and 8 children: Ole d.e. Osmundsen, who was myndig, married, and living at "Wisdals bøijden Langøyene for Riisø
2 CONC en"; Salve Osmundsen Veen at Bjerkreim, who was dead at the time, but had a daughter named Berte Salvesdatter; Gunder Osmundsen Virak, who was myndig; Ole d.y. Osmundsen, who who was myndig, married, and living at Handeland, Sirda
2 CONC l; Jakob Osmundsen, who who was myndig, married, and living at Øvstabø, at Høle; Barbro Osmundsdatter, married to Asbjørn Halvorsen Bjordal at Bjerkreim; Adlaug Osmundsdatter, who was dead, and had been married to Ole Halvorsen Tj
2 CONC ørhom, but seems to have left living children; and Åsa Osmundsdatter, married to Askild Mauritsen Solli, at Lund):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0008A: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL <1-348>, 1740-1741, s. 32b-33a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106690285
