1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [https://www.nb.no/items/77c60739b529aa5e7ddf70e0f4525809?page=224 "Sirdal bygdebok: Gard og ætt", Bind 2 (Feed, Gnr. 31, "Der heima", Bnr. 2, 1. Kidel Ljødesen Feed, p. 221)]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT [https://www.nb.no/items/77c60739b529aa5e7ddf70e0f4525809?page=224 "Sirdal bygdebok"] notes that it is possible that Joren Halvardsdatter was not the mother of all the children of Kjetil Ljødesen; implying that he may have been ma
2 CONC rried at least twice.The [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650400 probate after Joren], lists 4 of her sons by name, namely: Knut Kjetilsen Lindeland; Ole Kjetilsen Moi; Tosten Kjetilsen Sinnes; and Tron Kjetilsen Ousdal. I
2 CONC t also makes reference to other children, step-children (plural) and their decendants. It seems strange that Torkel Kjetilsen, who appears to have been the oldest son of Kjetil, is not mentioned in the probate after Joren, ''unles
2 CONC s he was her step-son''.
2 CONT ----
