2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record (2-04-1738; Joren was dead and her heirs were listed as the widower Lars Sigbjørnsen and 6 children):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0006B: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL, 1722-1739, s. 675b-676a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106680685
2 CONT ----
