1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.nb.no/items/c0f169f286ab8286ae56665fc0c9dabb?page=596 "Sirdal bygdebok"] suggests that Anders Madsen Tveiten/ Ødegården (Gjosdal) was married three times, as his wife is referred to as both Åsa and Gun
2 CONC vor (in addition to the last wife Valborg). This would explain why his second known daughter was named Åsa, i.e. suggesting that she was born by the II wife in honour of his deceased I wife, Åsa Rolleivsdatter Tveiten.
