1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Sogneprestenes manntall 1664-1666 (0-02-1664; "Ånen Jøelsen" is listed, without an age, at Handeland):'''
2 CONT RA, Sogneprestenes manntall 1664-1666, nr. 17: Jæren prosti og Dalane prosti, 1664-1666, s. 240-241. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10051005180135
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1701 Manntall ("Ånen Jøelsen" is claimed to be 60 years old at the time):'''
2 CONT RA, Manntallet 1701, nr. 4: Jæren og Dalane fogderi, 1701, s. 92-93. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10041010271060
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after his wife (05-02-1709; The wife was dead, and "Ånen Gunnufsen" is listed among the heirs):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0004: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL, 1708-1714, s. 54b-55a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106660351
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Ånen Gunnufsen is not listed with his father at Jendal-Ytre in the 1664 Manntall. There is however an "Ånen Jøelsen" listed at Handeland in the 1664 Manntall (yet only in Sokneprestens Manntall, not in Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes 
2 CONC Manntall). This "Ånen Jøelsen" is also listed at Handeland in the 1701 Manntall. It seems likely that "Ånen Jøelsen" and "Ånen Gunnufsen" is one and the same person. He is called "Ånen Gunnufsen" in the probate after his wife in 1
2 CONC 709. He is not listed at Lund i [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk10081305100449  "Skoskatten" of 1711], at which time his son-in-law Tor Svensen had taken over the farm. It should be noted that at this time there was also an "Ånen
2 CONC  Gunnarsen Handeland" (at gnr. 31.3), whose widow, "Eli Nilsdatter", was listed at Handeland in "Skoskatten" of 1711. This "Ånon Gunnarsen" was a different person.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=454 "Lunds historie", Bind 1 (G. nr. 31, Handeland, Br. nr. 9 - Handeland, I. Ånen Gunnusen, p. 453)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/86f2120d1cf6c399be7d31a8aba2e7fa?page=513 "Bjerkreimboka", Bind 1 (Bjordal, 10. Knud Torgerson, p. 510)]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lund historie I, Gårdens og slektens liv, Handeland, side 453, nr. I'''
2 CONT Ånen Gunnunsen. Ant. bror av Ole Gunnunsen Ytre Jendal, hvis sønn Jøel Olsen ble gift til Handeland, br. nr. 2.
