2 CONT '''Probate record (15-08-1693; both Karl and his II wife Anna appears to have died; and his children were listed as: Omund Hove; Asbjørn Eik; Karl, living at home, Lars living at home; the deceased daughter Guri and her daughter G
2 CONC unhild; Marta Hestad; and Siri, living at home):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0003: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106660029
2 CONT
