2 CONC sen Sandstøl; Marta, married to Jakob Moi; Helga, married to Peder Larsen Austad; Margrete, married to Hans Torgrimsen Hadland; and Gjøa, married to Torkel Nilsen Eik):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0004: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL, 1708-1714, s. 318b-319a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106660620
