1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Probate record after her husband (29-11-1728; Peder was dead, and the widow, Helga Atlaksdatter, is listed among the heirs):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, SAK/1221-0003/H/Hc/L0020: Skifteprotokoll nr 20 med register, 1725-1729, s. 530b-531a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081030311121
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record of her parents (23-06-1712; Both parents were still alive when they surrendered their estate to their children, which included Helga, married to Peder Larsen Austad):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0004: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL, 1708-1714, s. 318b-319a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106660620
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Is there any evidence that she died at Heskestad in 1738? There does not appear to be any such entry in the church or probate records at Heskestad.
2 CONT ----
