2 CONT '''Probate record (05-02-1709; Jon is claimed to have died 8 days before All Saints Day (i.e. 24-10-1708), and the heirs are listed as the widow, Anna Olsdatter, 2 sons and 7 daughters: Peder Jonsen, married and living at Steinber
2 CONC g; Karl Jonsen, soldier; Ingeborg Jonsdatter, married to Bjørn Knutsen Kjørmo; Ågot Jonsdatter, married to Torger Asbjørnsen Flatestøl; Anna Jonsdatter, married to Ole Anfinsen Austreim; the deceased Gjøa Jonsdatter Virak, who is 
2 CONC inherited by two minor daughters; Marit Jonsdatter, married to Jørgen Tollefsen Hestad, who is dead; Siri Jonsdatter, married to Omund Brynildsen Ualand; and Tora Jonsdatter, 24 years old, not married and living at home):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0004: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL, 1708-1714, s. 52b-53a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106660349
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after his mother (01-06-1668; Ågot had died, and Jon Pedersen is listed among the heirs, as the first of 4 sons):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0001: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650066
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record after his father (22-04-1672; Peder had died, and Jon Pedersen is listed among the heirs, as the first of 4 sons):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0001: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650155
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record after his mother (01-06-1668; Ågot had died, and Jon Pedersen is listed among the heirs, as the first of 4 sons):'''
