1 NAME Tollak /Osmundsen/
2 GIVN Tollak
2 SURN Osmundsen
2 _MARNM Osmundsen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 15 JUL 1826
2 ADDR
3 CITY Josdal
