1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There is some disagreement as to the identity of the first husband of Torborg Atlaksdatter Liland/ Regevik (Birkeland). [https://www.nb.no/items/4464e9d4db6d6fd39d9f11b64af65704?page=356 "Bakke bygdebok"] states th
2 CONC at the I husband was 'Askild Sigbjørnsen Liland'. This is also reported by [https://www.nb.no/items/77c60739b529aa5e7ddf70e0f4525809?page=418 "Sirdal bygdebok"]. Yet, in another location in [https://www.nb.no/items/c0f169f286ab828
2 CONC 6ae56665fc0c9dabb?page=131 "Sirdal bygdebok"], the husband is claimed to be 'Askild Svensen Liland'. In the section about 'Askild I Sigbjørnsen Liland' in [https://www.nb.no/items/c0f169f286ab8286ae56665fc0c9dabb?page=171 "Sirdal 
2 CONC bygdebok"], however, his wife is identified as 'Ingrid Vermundsdatter Tonstad', and it is reported that she was still alive in 1669. Thus, '''it seems unlikely that Torborg was married to Askild I Sigbjørnsen Liland'''.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/4464e9d4db6d6fd39d9f11b64af65704?page=356 "Bakke bygdebok: Gards- og slektshistorie" Del 2, Gardsnr. 135-150 (Birkeland, Bnr. 1, 3. Atlak Atlakson Birkeland, p. 353)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/c0f169f286ab8286ae56665fc0c9dabb?page=131 "Sirdal bygdebok: Gard og ætt", Bind 3 (Liland, Gnr. 41, "Haugen", Bnr. 16, 2. Askild Svensen Liland, p. 128)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/c0f169f286ab8286ae56665fc0c9dabb?page=131 "Sirdal bygdebok: Gard og ætt", Bind 3 (Liland, Gnr. 41, "Haugen", Bnr. 16, 1. Sven Askildsen Liland, p. 128)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/c0f169f286ab8286ae56665fc0c9dabb?page=171 "Sirdal bygdebok: Gard og ætt", Bind 3 (Liland, Gnr. 41, "Der framme", Bnr. 4, 2. Askild Sigbjørnsen Liland I, p. 168)]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT There is some disagreement as to the identity of the first husband of Torborg Atlaksdatter Liland/ Regevik (Birkeland). [https://www.nb.no/items/4464e9d4db6d6fd39d9f11b64af65704?page=356 "Bakke bygdebok"] states that the I husband
2 CONC  was 'Askild Sigbjørnsen Liland'. This is also reported by [https://www.nb.no/items/77c60739b529aa5e7ddf70e0f4525809?page=418 "Sirdal bygdebok"]. Yet, in another location in [https://www.nb.no/items/c0f169f286ab8286ae56665fc0c9dab
2 CONC b?page=131 "Sirdal bygdebok"], the husband is claimed to be 'Askild Svensen Liland'. In the section about 'Askild I Sigbjørnsen Liland' in [https://www.nb.no/items/c0f169f286ab8286ae56665fc0c9dabb?page=171 "Sirdal bygdebok"], howe
2 CONC ver, his wife is identified as 'Ingrid Vermundsdatter Tonstad', and it is reported that she was still alive in 1669. Thus, '''it seems unlikely that Torborg was married to Askild I Sigbjørnsen Liland'''.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/4464e9d4db6d6fd39d9f11b64af65704?page=356 "Bakke bygdebok: Gards- og slektshistorie" Del 2, Gardsnr. 135-150 (Birkeland, Bnr. 1, 3. Atlak Atlakson Birkeland, p. 353)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/c0f169f286ab8286ae56665fc0c9dabb?page=131 "Sirdal bygdebok: Gard og ætt", Bind 3 (Liland, Gnr. 41, "Haugen", Bnr. 16, 2. Askild Svensen Liland, p. 128)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/c0f169f286ab8286ae56665fc0c9dabb?page=131 "Sirdal bygdebok: Gard og ætt", Bind 3 (Liland, Gnr. 41, "Haugen", Bnr. 16, 1. Sven Askildsen Liland, p. 128)]
