1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Probate record (22-07-1707; Nils and Gunvor were both still alive when they surrendered their estate to the heirs; which arre listed as his 2 children with his first wife: Asbjørn Nilsen Fosdal; Gjertrud Nilsdat
2 CONC ter, who had died but left children with her husband Asbjørn Espetveit; his 4 children with his second wife: Atlak Nilsen, Siri Nilsdatter, married to Osmund Oftedal; Anna Nilsdatter, married to Tron Moi; Siri d.y. Nilsdatter, mar
2 CONC ried to Gunstein Bakke; and the 4 children with Gunvor: Tor Nilsen; Tore Nilsen, Salve Nilsen; and Kari Nilsdatter):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, AV/SAK-1221-0003/H/Hc/L0010: Skifteprotokoll nr 10 med register, 1704-1706, s. 62b-63a. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081029350349
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record (22-07-1707; Nils and Gunvor were both still alive when they surrendered their estate to the heirs; which arre listed as his 2 children with his first wife: Asbjørn Nilsen Fosdal; Gjertrud Nilsdatter, who had die
2 CONC d but left children with her husband Asbjørn Espetveit; his 4 children with his second wife: Atlak Nilsen, Siri Nilsdatter, married to Osmund Oftedal; Anna Nilsdatter, married to Tron Moi; Siri d.y. Nilsdatter, married to Gunstein
2 CONC  Bakke; and the 4 children with Gunvor: Tor Nilsen; Tore Nilsen, Salve Nilsen; and Kari Nilsdatter):'''
2 CONT Lister sorenskriveri, AV/SAK-1221-0003/H, s. 35593. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk11214091235595
