2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/4464e9d4db6d6fd39d9f11b64af65704?page=387 "Bakke bygdebok: Gards- og slektshistorie" Del 2, Gardsnr. 135-150 (Birkeland, Bnr. 17. "Vollen", Prestevegen 22, 1. Nils Atlakson Birkeland, p. 384)]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Some contributor(s) here at Geni have suggested that Gunvor Halvorsdatter Birkeland was a daughter of Halvor Asbjørnsen Mjåsund and Ingrid Pedersdatter Mjåsund. '''This is NOT correct'''. No such daughter is listed in [https://www
2 CONC .nb.no/items/e4c1868422e6e51ea5fa87ac3cc8ccaa?page=238 "Bakke bygdebok"], and this source reveals that the children of that couple were born in the 1690s. Gunvor Halvorsdatter Birkeland was most likely born before Halvor Asbjørnse
2 CONC n Mjåsund, who was born about 1651.
2 CONT ----
