1 NAME Ivar Olsen /Hetleskogmoen/
2 GIVN Ivar Olsen
2 _MARNM Hetleskogmoen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1781
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
