1 NAME Halvard Mauritsson /Hompland/
2 GIVN Halvard Mauritsson
2 SURN Hompland
2 _MARNM Austrumdal
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1680
2 PLAC Hompland, Sirdal, Vest-Agder
2 ADDR
